+  ```ts
+  if (isRowLoading) return;
+  if (boundsError) {
+    startBounds.refetch();
+    if (!isSinglePage) endBounds.refetch();
+    return;
+  }
+  if (!bounds) return;
+  ```
+  and the `play()` call reads `bounds.firstVerseKey` / `bounds.lastVerseKey` /
+  `bounds.lastChapterId`.
